{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Donkey Jump</strong> is a quirky roguelike where every leap brings chaos, coins, and unexpected surprises! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your silly long\u2011eared hero jumps forward non\u2011stop, looping back to the start again and again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins, build your own path with cards, and survive against wild global challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856360/extras/2a3509e9de5a4fe9a4b59ed4f4c39259.poster.avif?t=1765880229\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856360/extras/2a3509e9de5a4fe9a4b59ed4f4c39259.webm?t=1765880229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856360/extras/2a3509e9de5a4fe9a4b59ed4f4c39259.mp4?t=1765880229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Loops</strong> \u2014 Every jump earns coins, every loop resets the stage, and the madness never ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Path</strong> \u2014 Use building cards from the shop to craft your playfield. Safe route\u2026 or total chaos?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Challenges</strong> \u2014 Sudden storms, random obstacles, corrupted tiles \u2014 the world really wants this donkey to fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luck &amp; Strategy</strong> \u2014 Adapt on the fly, take risks, and push your luck in Infinite Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goofy Chaos</strong> \u2014 Cartoonish style, silly animations, and laugh\u2011out\u2011loud moment